<title>JAPAN: Mitsui &amp; Co changes rules for share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Mitsui &amp; Co changes rules for share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading house Mitsui &amp; Co Ltd said on Friday that it had changed its company rules so that it would be able to buy up to 150 million of its own shares.</p>
<p>The change was approved at the company's annual shareholders' meeting on Friday, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Mitsui is considering introducing a stock option scheme for its employees, but the issue was not discussed at the shareholders' meeting, the spokesman said.</p>
</text>
